        "**Attack rate** is incidence as a percentage of those exposed, used in an outbreak because the epidemic is over before a year passes. [Park 27e]",
        "**Secondary attack rate** = exposed susceptible contacts falling ill in one incubation period / all exposed susceptibles - it times transmission. [Park 27e]",
