        "ICDS service 1 is **supplementary nutrition**, service 2 **immunisation** - food alone fails while infection keeps consuming it. [Poshan 2.0 2022]",
        "Service 3 **health check-up**, service 4 **referral** - screening is worthless unless the positive child has somewhere to go. [Poshan 2.0 2022]",
