        "Sanitary well: lined to **3 m**, parapet **70-75 cm**, platform **1 m** sloping to a drain - each feature blocks one route of surface entry. [Park 27e]",
        "Sanitary well must be covered and drawn by a hand pump - not by rope and bucket. [Park 27e]",
        "**The sanitary survey of the source is the first step** in any water-borne outbreak - the defect is usually visible before any test returns. [Park 27e]",
