        "Preparedness covers stockpiling of drugs, food, fuel and equipment, training of staff and community volunteers, and mock drills. [NDMA 2019]",
        "Preparedness ends with a **resource inventory carrying named responsibilities** - that is what turns a plan on paper into a response. [NDMA 2019]",
        "**Response or relief** is the action during and immediately after impact to save life and limit damage. [Park 27e]",
