        "**Recovery** is the restoration of the community and divides into rehabilitation and reconstruction. [Park 27e]",
        "**Rehabilitation** is short and medium term: restoring services, temporary shelter, livelihood support, restarting schools and health services, mental health care. [Park 27e]",
