      id: "preventive-disaster-management-q1",
      stem: "A cyclone damages six blocks across two districts. The District Magistrates report that district resources are exhausted; the state government mobilises the State Disaster Response Force and state resources, and the National Disaster Response Force battalions are placed on standby but not yet deployed. Under the Indian classification, this is:",
