        "Calculate the float on every non-critical activity, allot resources and crash where necessary. [Park 27e]",
        "**Then use the network to monitor the project**, updating it whenever an activity finishes early or late. [Park 27e]",
        "**A network forces a complete listing of activities and their interdependence, which a Gantt chart (Henry Gantt, 1917) does not show**. [Park 27e]",
