        "**Clarity**: simple words, one main idea, an unambiguous action - two ideas in one message means neither is acted on. [Park 27e]",
        "**Continuity and consistency**: repeated over time through different channels without contradiction - contradiction destroys credibility. [Park 27e]",
        "**Channels**: the ones the audience uses and trusts - not the ones the department finds convenient to use. [Park 27e]",
