        "Other quotable examples: **LLIN bed nets** under the malaria elimination framework - free distribution removed the price entirely. [NCVBDC 2016]",
        "Other examples: **subsidised sanitary napkins** under the Menstrual Hygiene Scheme, and the Swachh Bharat toilet - both stigma-prone products. [SBM 2014]",
        "**Social media give enormous reach at low marginal cost** - and allow targeting by age, place, language and interest. [WHO 2023]",
