    "**Two or more workers from the same workplace with the same illness** - an occupational cluster and a public health emergency in miniature; treat it as an outbreak, visit the workplace with a walk-through survey, list the exposed, and notify the factory inspectorate and district health authority rather than managing the cases one by one.",
