        "**The greenhouse effect is natural and necessary** - short-wave solar radiation warms the earth, which re-radiates long-wave infrared. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
        "Greenhouse gases trap that infrared, holding mean temperature near **15 degrees C not minus 18** - the excess is the problem, not the effect. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
