        "**Carbon dioxide is the largest contributor** - from fossil fuel combustion, deforestation and cement. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
        "**Carbon dioxide has risen from about 280 ppm pre-industrial to about 420 ppm** - a 50% rise, and it persists for centuries once emitted. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
