        "**Nitrous oxide** from fertiliser and biomass burning has about **265 times** the potential of carbon dioxide - and survives over a century. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
        "**Fluorinated gases** are thousands of times more potent though present in tiny amounts - so a small leak matters more than its volume suggests. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
        "**Black carbon and tropospheric ozone are short-lived climate pollutants** - cutting them gives a health gain and a climate gain at once. [WHO 2023]",
        "**Global temperature in 2011-2020 was about 1.1 degrees C above the 1850-1900 baseline** - the baseline is pre-industrial by definition. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
        "**Sea level rose about 0.20 m between 1901 and 2018** and now rises about **3.7 mm a year** - the rate is accelerating, not steady. [IPCC AR6 2023]",
