    "**Never map identifiable patients.** A dot at a household in a village, labelled with HIV, tuberculosis, mental illness or abortion, is a disclosure of confidential information however good the intention - aggregate to village, ward or grid, suppress small numbers, jitter or geomask published points, and keep the co-ordinate file restricted and consented.",
