    "**A cluster is not an outbreak until chance has been excluded.** Among hundreds of districts or wards, extremes appear by chance alone, and the eye finds clusters in random points; apply a scan statistic, check ascertainment, and look for the same cluster in an independent period before mounting an investigation.",
